GETINTPOPUP $_ "Set the PCB on the bottom half of the jig."
setvac port_18 1 #bottom half
GETINTPOPUP $_ "Set the film on the top half of the jig."
setvac port_20 1 #top half
GETINTPOPUP $_ "Apply the film on the PCB."
setvac port_20 0 #top half
GETINTPOPUP $_ "Open the cover."
setvac port_18 0 #bottom half